{"suttaId":"thag14.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[2650,2691],"vripara":"645"},"segments":{"thag14.1:0.4":"Khadiravaniyarevatattheragāthā","thag14.1:1.1":"“Yadā ahaṃ pabbajito, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thag14.1:1.3":"Nābhijānāmi saṅkappaṃ, anariyaṃ dosasaṃhitaṃ.","thag14.1:2.1":"“‘Ime haññantu vajjhantu, dukkhaṃ pappontu pāṇino’;","thag14.1:2.3":"Saṅkappaṃ nābhijānāmi, imasmiṃ dīghamantare.","thag14.1:3.1":"“Mettañca abhijānāmi, appamāṇaṃ subhāvitaṃ;","thag14.1:3.3":"Anupubbaṃ paricitaṃ, yathā buddhena desitaṃ.","thag14.1:4.1":"“Sabbamitto sabbasakho, sabbabhūtānukampako;","thag14.1:4.3":"Mettacittañca [mettaṃ cittaṃ (sī. syā.)] bhāvemi, abyāpajjarato [abyāpajjharato (sī. syā.)] sadā.","thag14.1:5.1":"“Asaṃhīraṃ asaṃkuppaṃ, cittaṃ āmodayāmahaṃ;","thag14.1:5.3":"Brahmavihāraṃ bhāvemi, akāpurisasevitaṃ.","thag14.1:6.1":"“Avitakkaṃ samāpanno, sammāsambuddhasāvako;","thag14.1:6.3":"Ariyena tuṇhībhāvena, upeto hoti tāvade.","thag14.1:7.1":"“Yathāpi pabbato selo, acalo suppatiṭṭhito;","thag14.1:7.3":"Evaṃ mohakkhayā bhikkhu, pabbatova na vedhati.","thag14.1:8.1":"“Anaṅgaṇassa posassa, niccaṃ sucigavesino;","thag14.1:8.3":"Vālaggamattaṃ pāpassa, abbhamattaṃva khāyati.","thag14.1:9.1":"“Nagaraṃ yathā paccantaṃ, guttaṃ santarabāhiraṃ;","thag14.1:9.3":"Evaṃ gopetha attānaṃ, khaṇo vo mā upaccagā.","thag14.1:10.1":"“Nābhinandāmi maraṇaṃ, nābhinandāmi jīvitaṃ;","thag14.1:10.3":"Kālañca paṭikaṅkhāmi, nibbisaṃ bhatako yathā.","thag14.1:11.1":"“Nābhinandāmi maraṇaṃ … pe … sampajāno patissato.","thag14.1:12.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thag14.1:12.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thag14.1:13.1":"“Yassa catthāya pabbajito, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thag14.1:13.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thag14.1:14.1":"“Sampādethappamādena, esā me anusāsanī;","thag14.1:14.3":"Handāhaṃ parinibbissaṃ, vippamuttomhi sabbadhī”ti.","thag14.1:14.5":"… Khadiravaniyarevato thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
